ibus-sherpa-onnx (0.3.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Utterance splits use our own PCM quiet detector (`pcm_quiet_endpoint`:
      ~1.2 s below a peak floor) instead of sherpa-onnx `is_endpoint` (model
      blank runs). Decode still produces the words; line breaks follow the
      audio. We believe this yields effectively perfect dictation transcription
      versus the previous blank-based chopper, which could miss or mis-cut
      words.
  * Debug listen recordings + Preferences Debug / Browse are compile-time
      optional (`-Ddebug_recordings=true`); off by default so normal packages
      do not ship or enable that path.


 -- Alan Knowles <alan@roojs.com>  Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
